# Ship workflow (games-cards)

## Before PR

```bash
make ci
/staff-review
/pr-ready          # opens PR via GitHub MCP when asked
```

## After merge — ship

```bash
/ship
```

Agent uses **GitHub MCP** (`user-github`):

- `pull_request_read` → `get_check_runs` (CI on PR)
- `list_commits`, `get_commit`, `get_latest_release`, `list_tags`

Always run locally:

```bash
make up
make ship-check    # ci + smoke + postman
```

## Release tag (creates GitHub Release via Actions)

```bash
git pull origin main
git tag v1.1.0
git push origin v1.1.0
```

Workflow `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes release notes.

## Production deploy

Only after explicit **"deploy to prod"** — follow `DEPLOY.md`.
